{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "name": "Trailer Room",
  "description": "One agent writes the beats and the shot list, renders every shot, cuts them together and lays a score under the cut. You see each decision and tool call as it happens.",
  "app": {
    "schemaVersion": 4,
    "ui": {
      "root": {
        "props": {}
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "Heading",
          "props": {
            "id": "title",
            "text": "🎞️ Trailer Room",
            "level": "1",
            "subtitle": "Give an agent your premise and watch it direct, cut and score the teaser."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Text",
          "props": {
            "id": "app-note",
            "text": "💸 One run spends one image and one video generation per shot, one music generation, and the agent's own model turns.",
            "tone": "hint"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Stepper",
          "props": {
            "id": "steps",
            "binding": "var:step",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": "direct-the-teaser",
                "title": "Direct the teaser"
              }
            ],
            "allowBack": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "Container",
          "props": {
            "id": "step-direct-the-teaser",
            "variant": "plain",
            "visibleWhen": {
              "binding": "var:step",
              "op": "eq",
              "value": "direct-the-teaser"
            },
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "Heading",
                "props": {
                  "id": "heading-direct-the-teaser",
                  "text": "Direct the teaser",
                  "level": "2"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Columns",
                "props": {
                  "id": "cols-direct-the-teaser",
                  "gap": 24,
                  "left": [
                    {
                      "type": "TextInput",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "in-premise",
                        "binding": "var:premise",
                        "label": "Your trailer in one line",
                        "multiline": true,
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "TextInput",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "in-style",
                        "binding": "var:style",
                        "label": "Visual style",
                        "multiline": true,
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "NumberInput",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "in-direct-shots",
                        "binding": "op:direct/in:shots",
                        "label": "Number of shots",
                        "min": 3,
                        "max": 10,
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "ModelSelect",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "model-agentmodel",
                        "binding": "var:agentModel",
                        "label": "Agent model",
                        "modelKind": "language_model",
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "ModelSelect",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "model-imagemodel",
                        "binding": "var:imageModel",
                        "label": "Image model",
                        "modelKind": "image_model",
                        "task": "text_to_image",
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "ModelSelect",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "model-videomodel",
                        "binding": "var:videoModel",
                        "label": "Video model",
                        "modelKind": "video_model",
                        "task": "image_to_video",
                        "events": []
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Button",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "btn-direct",
                        "label": "Direct the teaser",
                        "variant": "contained",
                        "color": "primary",
                        "events": [
                          {
                            "trigger": "click",
                            "kind": "run",
                            "operationId": "direct",
                            "key": "",
                            "value": ""
                          }
                        ],
                        "disabledWhen": {
                          "binding": "op:direct/exec#running",
                          "op": "notEmpty"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ],
                  "right": [
                    {
                      "type": "AgentActivity",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "transcript-direct",
                        "binding": "op:direct/exec#transcript",
                        "label": "What the agent is doing",
                        "placeholder": "Beats, shots, renders and the cut appear here."
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Alert",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "error-direct",
                        "binding": "op:direct/exec#error",
                        "title": "Directing failed",
                        "text": "",
                        "severity": "error",
                        "visibleWhen": {
                          "binding": "op:direct/exec#error",
                          "op": "notEmpty"
                        }
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Heading",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "lbl-cut",
                        "text": "The cut",
                        "level": "3"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Video",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "out-cut",
                        "binding": "var:cut",
                        "height": 320,
                        "placeholder": "Your video appears here"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Heading",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "lbl-direct-notes",
                        "text": "The director's notes",
                        "level": "3"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Markdown",
                      "props": {
                        "id": "out-direct-notes",
                        "binding": "op:direct/out:notes",
                        "text": ""
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Divider",
                "props": {
                  "id": "divider-direct-the-teaser"
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "Columns",
                "props": {
                  "id": "nav-direct-the-teaser",
                  "gap": 16,
                  "left": [],
                  "right": []
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "zones": {}
    },
    "operations": [
      {
        "id": "direct",
        "name": "Direct",
        "workflowId": "",
        "inputs": {
          "premise": {
            "from": "variable",
            "variableId": "premise"
          },
          "style": {
            "from": "variable",
            "variableId": "style"
          },
          "model": {
            "from": "variable",
            "variableId": "agentModel"
          },
          "image_model": {
            "from": "variable",
            "variableId": "imageModel"
          },
          "video_model": {
            "from": "variable",
            "variableId": "videoModel"
          }
        },
        "outputs": {
          "trailer": {
            "to": "variable",
            "variableId": "cut"
          }
        },
        "policy": "replace",
        "timeoutMs": 1800000,
        "target": {
          "kind": "script",
          "scriptId": "direct",
          "scriptVersion": 1
        }
      }
    ],
    "resources": [],
    "variables": [
      {
        "id": "step",
        "name": "Step",
        "type": {
          "type": "str",
          "optional": true
        },
        "default": "direct-the-teaser",
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "premise",
        "name": "Premise",
        "type": {
          "type": "str",
          "optional": true
        },
        "default": "A getaway driver speeds onto a bridge as it starts to collapse behind her.",
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "style",
        "name": "Visual style",
        "type": {
          "type": "str",
          "optional": true
        },
        "default": "Anamorphic night photography, wet asphalt, sodium light, heavy grain.",
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "cut",
        "name": "The cut",
        "type": {
          "type": "video",
          "optional": true
        },
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "agentModel",
        "name": "Agent model",
        "type": {
          "type": "language_model",
          "optional": true
        },
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "imageModel",
        "name": "Image model",
        "type": {
          "type": "image_model",
          "optional": true
        },
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      },
      {
        "id": "videoModel",
        "name": "Video model",
        "type": {
          "type": "video_model",
          "optional": true
        },
        "scope": "instance",
        "persist": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "workflows": [],
  "scripts": [
    {
      "key": "direct",
      "name": "Direct a Trailer",
      "sourceId": "nodetool-base/Direct a Trailer",
      "document": {
        "schemaVersion": 1,
        "description": "Runs one agent that plans, renders, cuts and scores a teaser trailer from a premise.",
        "code": "\nimport { run_agent } from \"@nodetool-ai/sandbox-nodetool/agents\";\n\nconst premise = String(inputs.premise ?? \"\").trim();\nif (!premise) throw new Error(\"Write the premise before you direct the teaser.\");\nconst style = String(inputs.style ?? \"\").trim();\nconst shots = Math.max(3, Math.min(10, Number(inputs.shots) || 6));\nconst picked = inputs.model?.id ? inputs.model : await nodetool.models.pick(\"generate_message\");\nconst ref = async ([chosen, capability]) => {\n  const hit = chosen?.id ? chosen : await nodetool.models.pick(capability);\n  const { provider, id } = hit.ref || hit;\n  return \"provider \" + provider + \", model \" + id;\n};\nconst [imageModel, videoModel, musicModel] = await Promise.all(\n  [\n    [inputs.image_model, \"text_to_image\"],\n    [inputs.video_model, \"image_to_video\"],\n    [null, \"text_to_music\"]\n  ].map(ref)\n);\n\nconst answer = await run_agent({\n  label: \"director\",\n  model: picked.ref || picked,\n  max_turns: 40,\n  tools: [\"generate_batch\", \"generate_music\", \"media_probe\", \"media_edit\"],\n  system: \"You are a trailer director. Decide, say what you decided in one or two sentences, then act with your tools. Use only the asset URIs your tools return.\",\n  prompt: [\n    \"Direct a teaser trailer from start to finish.\",\n    \"Premise: \" + premise,\n    \"Visual style: \" + (style || \"choose one that fits the premise\"),\n    \"Number of shots: \" + shots,\n    \"\",\n    \"1. Write the beat sheet: hook, escalation, turn and title card, with timings.\",\n    \"2. Write the numbered shot list: subject, framing, camera move and duration. Repeat the visual style in every shot prompt. Allow no on-screen text.\",\n    \"3. Make every still in one generate_batch call: one generate_image request per shot, at 16:9, with \" + imageModel + \". Label each request with its shot.\",\n    \"4. Animate every still in one more generate_batch call: one animate_image request per still, with \" + videoModel + \".\",\n    \"5. Keep each clip to the duration in your shot list.\",\n    \"6. Call media_edit with operation concat, the clip asset URIs in shot order, and output_file cut.mp4. Check it with media_probe.\",\n    \"7. Call generate_music for a bed as long as the cut, with \" + musicModel + \". Then call media_edit with operation add_audio and output_file trailer.mp4.\",\n    \"8. Submit the asset URI of the final file and your notes.\",\n    \"\",\n    \"Retry a failed call once. If a shot fails again, cut without it and say so. Do not regenerate a shot only to improve it.\",\n    \"If you cannot finish, still submit: leave trailer_uri empty and say in the notes which step failed and why.\"\n  ].join(\"\\n\"),\n  output_schema: {\n    type: \"object\",\n    properties: { trailer_uri: { type: \"string\" }, notes: { type: \"string\" } },\n    required: [\"notes\"]\n  }\n});\nif (answer.error) throw new Error(answer.error);\nawait output(\"notes\", answer.result.notes);\nif (!answer.result.trailer_uri) throw new Error(\"The agent made no trailer. Its notes say why.\");\nawait output(\"trailer\", { type: \"video\", uri: answer.result.trailer_uri });\n",
        "inputs": [
          {
            "name": "premise",
            "type": "str"
          },
          {
            "name": "style",
            "type": "str"
          },
          {
            "name": "shots",
            "type": "int"
          },
          {
            "name": "model",
            "type": "language_model"
          },
          {
            "name": "image_model",
            "type": "image_model"
          },
          {
            "name": "video_model",
            "type": "video_model"
          }
        ],
        "outputs": [
          {
            "name": "trailer",
            "type": "video"
          },
          {
            "name": "notes",
            "type": "str"
          }
        ],
        "secrets": [],
        "timeoutSeconds": 1800,
        "tests": []
      },
      "version": null
    }
  ]
}
